# Milestone: M3
# Covers: throw inside finally body (C-1 replace-on-raise); new exception
#         supersedes original; no outer catch → strand terminates fatally.
# The old core swallowed non-object throws and answered nil; the
# re-foundation reports them (spec section 9), so the 2 that replaced the
# 1 is what surfaces.

try { throw 1 } finally { throw 2 }
[00000001] !!! 2
